@startuml View School News (Student View) by Student
actor Student
participant ": SystemAnnouncementsPage " as SystemAnnouncementsPage
participant ": Router " as Router
participant ": SystemAnnouncementController " as SystemAnnouncementController
participant ": SystemAnnouncementService " as SystemAnnouncementService
participant ": PostRepository " as PostRepository
database Database

Student->SystemAnnouncementsPage: 1. Navigate to School News page
    activate Student
    activate SystemAnnouncementsPage

SystemAnnouncementsPage->SystemAnnouncementsPage: 2. Render School News Page

SystemAnnouncementsPage->Router: 3. Send GET /api/systemannouncement/public
    deactivate SystemAnnouncementsPage
    activate Router

Router->SystemAnnouncementController: 4. Route Request to Controller
    deactivate Router
    activate SystemAnnouncementController

SystemAnnouncementController->SystemAnnouncementService: 5. GetPublicAnnouncementsAsync()
    deactivate SystemAnnouncementController
    activate SystemAnnouncementService

SystemAnnouncementService->PostRepository: 6. GetQueryable()
    activate PostRepository

PostRepository->Database: 7. Query Posts with Attachments
    activate Database

Database-->PostRepository: 8. Return Posts query with relations
    deactivate Database

PostRepository-->SystemAnnouncementService: 9. Return IQueryable<Post>
    deactivate PostRepository

SystemAnnouncementService->SystemAnnouncementService: 10. Filter: IsSystemAnnouncement = true, !IsDeleted, Status = Published, (ExpiryDate is null or ExpiryDate > Now)

SystemAnnouncementService->SystemAnnouncementService: 11. Order by IsUrgent DESC, CreatedAt DESC

SystemAnnouncementService->Database: 12. Execute query and get results
    activate Database

Database-->SystemAnnouncementService: 13. Return List<Post> with Attachments
    deactivate Database

SystemAnnouncementService->SystemAnnouncementService: 14. Map to SystemAnnouncementDto[]

SystemAnnouncementService-->SystemAnnouncementController: 15. Return List<SystemAnnouncementDto>
    activate SystemAnnouncementController
    deactivate SystemAnnouncementService

SystemAnnouncementController-->Router: 16. Send School News Response
    activate Router
    deactivate SystemAnnouncementController

Router-->SystemAnnouncementsPage: 17. Display School News List
    activate SystemAnnouncementsPage
    deactivate Router

SystemAnnouncementsPage->SystemAnnouncementsPage: 18. Render Announcement Cards (Title, Content, Type, IsUrgent, CreatedAt, Attachments)

SystemAnnouncementsPage->SystemAnnouncementsPage: 19. Show urgent announcements first

SystemAnnouncementsPage-->Student: 20. Show Complete School News List
    deactivate SystemAnnouncementsPage
    deactivate Student
@enduml




